WEBVTT

00:14.774 --> 00:21.114
Deai wa kitto kokoro no yoake

00:21.114 --> 00:27.454
Atarashii kaze ga soko kara umareru

00:27.454 --> 00:33.894
Hitori ja nai to kizuita toki ni

00:33.894 --> 00:40.404
Tsukitooru tsuki wa hohemi wo kureru

00:40.404 --> 00:46.774
Sono toki tamashii ni kikoeru prelude wa

00:46.774 --> 00:52.944
Natsukashikute, tada fushigi na uta

00:52.944 --> 00:56.154
We are not alone

00:56.154 --> 00:59.324
Hito wa minna

00:59.324 --> 01:07.494
Dareka to deau tame umarete kuru, kitto

01:07.494 --> 01:15.174
Ah, hateshinai kono sekai e

01:15.174 --> 01:23.474
Sou, ai wo sagasu tame ni

01:40.794 --> 01:42.024
Tatsuya...

01:42.694 --> 01:44.034
Just now, you said...

01:44.434 --> 01:45.994
And I'll keep saying it.

01:46.634 --> 01:48.264
I love you.

01:48.834 --> 01:51.044
I want to be with you forever, Feena.

01:51.044 --> 01:53.004
I want to make our dreams come true together.

01:55.074 --> 01:56.514
Tatsuya...

01:58.084 --> 02:00.944
I... You...

02:01.354 --> 02:04.544
You... You're...

02:06.654 --> 02:09.144
Don't make such a pained-looking face.

02:09.554 --> 02:11.424
But I...

02:11.424 --> 02:16.094
I get it. The princess of the Moon
can't choose her words or actions lightly.

02:16.234 --> 02:17.694
Tatsuya...

02:17.804 --> 02:21.274
Right now, I have to prove it to myself...

02:21.274 --> 02:26.204
To see that Tatsuya Asagiri is worthy
of standing beside the future lunar queen.

02:26.674 --> 02:30.544
No matter what, I want to be with you!

02:40.024 --> 02:41.494
Thank you.

02:43.124 --> 02:44.994
First, we have to deal with that guy.

02:44.994 --> 02:46.424
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky

02:46.424 --> 02:49.764
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky
With the Princess Beneath
the Bright Blue Sky

02:49.764 --> 02:50.964
- Episode 8-
With the Princess
Beneath the Bright Blue Sky

02:53.434 --> 02:54.694
Please!

02:54.874 --> 03:01.944
And what if I do approve of your relationship?
I am a mere servant.

03:01.944 --> 03:07.404
You are also my father and departed mother's
most trusted subject.

03:09.514 --> 03:14.544
You are the only one who could mediate
between ourselves and my father.

03:16.294 --> 03:22.424
Neither nobility nor those who would enter their
ranks are the type to bow their heads lightly.

03:23.634 --> 03:28.434
As you know, relations between the Earth
and the Moon cannot be called "good".

03:28.734 --> 03:30.504
With the situation as it is,

03:30.504 --> 03:36.074
when it is known that the princess studied on
Earth and chose an Earthling as her fiancé,

03:36.074 --> 03:38.414
how do you think the people
of the Moon will react?

03:38.414 --> 03:40.354
Uh, that is...

03:40.354 --> 03:44.414
If you had not even considered that,
then you have prepared for this quite poorly.

03:44.654 --> 03:46.314
That's going too far, Karen!

03:46.724 --> 03:49.454
The people will lose their trust
in the royal family.

03:49.454 --> 03:53.564
The aristocracy may accuse the royal family
of a secret pact with Earth...

03:53.564 --> 03:56.194
In which case, the Sphere Kingdom
will become divided,

03:56.194 --> 03:58.964
leading to disarray while the Earth
interferes politically by...

03:58.964 --> 03:59.164
That has nothing to do with the here and now!
Leading to disarray while the Earth
interferes politically by...

03:59.164 --> 04:01.864
That has nothing to do with the here and now!

04:02.104 --> 04:04.444
But the odds of it happening are extremely high.

04:04.444 --> 04:08.964
Thus, I would ask if your preparations
have also accounted for this.

04:09.344 --> 04:12.214
If all you have to show is
the vaguest of preparedness,

04:12.214 --> 04:15.944
then as your subject, I flatly refuse
to approve your relationship!

04:21.024 --> 04:26.424
If your choice would bring misfortune
to yourself and those close to you,

04:26.424 --> 04:28.094
could you continue with it?

04:30.564 --> 04:32.094
Tatsuya...

04:32.464 --> 04:34.194
I don't think I could.

04:34.734 --> 04:39.804
I'm powerless, and still don't really
understand what the nobility even is.

04:41.144 --> 04:44.084
Then this discussion is finished.

04:44.084 --> 04:46.704
But if I'm with Feena...

04:47.714 --> 04:52.514
If Feena is by my side, then I can definitely
overcome any challenge!

04:53.824 --> 04:57.264
Together, we can make the best possible future.

04:57.264 --> 05:00.224
That is my conviction, and it will not falter!

05:00.434 --> 05:01.694
Tatsuya...

05:04.464 --> 05:07.124
Very well. Then you will allow me
to verify that conviction.

05:07.674 --> 05:12.004
I will provide Tatsuya with a test.
My decision shall rest upon the results.

05:12.204 --> 05:14.474
Um... A test?

05:16.144 --> 05:20.084
You will challenge Miss Feena
to a test of swordsmanship.

05:21.584 --> 05:25.424
Your weapons shall be bamboo swords.
The time is one week hence.

05:25.424 --> 05:27.824
I will inform you of the time and place
at a later date.

05:28.594 --> 05:29.754
Don't be ridiculous!

05:29.754 --> 05:33.864
Tatsuya has only basic sword skills
learned as part of his school curriculum!

05:33.864 --> 05:36.994
Of course, you are free to accept
or not, as you wish.

05:37.264 --> 05:39.204
I misjudged you, Karen.

05:39.204 --> 05:40.664
I'll do it, Feena.

05:40.874 --> 05:41.924
Tatsuya...

05:42.234 --> 05:47.034
True I don't think I can beat you...
But I won't back down!

05:49.414 --> 05:51.714
So you shouldn't either.

05:57.454 --> 05:59.324
That's just cruel!

05:59.324 --> 06:01.654
Feena's a really great fencer, right?

06:01.654 --> 06:04.624
Well? Are you going to give up?

06:04.624 --> 06:09.234
No way! Even if I don't have a chance
of winning, I won't give up.

06:09.234 --> 06:10.724
Big Brother...

06:10.804 --> 06:17.064
Really? Then I have nothing to add.
Good luck, Tatsuya!

06:18.574 --> 06:25.614
But I think my selfishness is going to turn this
into a big headache, especially for you, Sis.

06:25.614 --> 06:26.544
I'm sorry.

06:29.654 --> 06:32.524
It's okay. We're family, right?

06:32.524 --> 06:36.284
That's right! I'm rooting for you, Brother!

06:36.624 --> 06:38.894
Sis... Mai...

06:39.594 --> 06:40.784
Thank you!

06:41.894 --> 06:45.524
Madam Princess! Why won't you come out?

06:45.664 --> 06:47.634
Madam Princess!

06:48.274 --> 06:49.534
Mother...

06:49.904 --> 06:54.364
Does this mean I have to decide this for myself?

06:55.074 --> 06:58.344
Please tell me! Mother!

07:04.554 --> 07:08.684
Loving someone from a different social rank
sure is harder than I thought.

07:08.894 --> 07:11.164
Tatsuya... I'm sorry.

07:11.164 --> 07:12.954
Don't apologize, Natsuki.

07:13.934 --> 07:16.464
In the end, I was the one who decided this.

07:16.464 --> 07:20.704
But I... it was irresponsible of me
to get you all fired up about it.

07:20.704 --> 07:24.574
I'm grateful to you for that!
There's nothing for you to apologize for!

07:24.644 --> 07:25.864
Tatsuya...

07:26.544 --> 07:29.074
Things may look bleak, but I still have a chance.

07:29.074 --> 07:31.064
I'll just do everything that I can!

07:31.984 --> 07:33.644
Mia! Where's Feena?

07:33.644 --> 07:36.944
She's locked herself in her room since last night.

07:37.124 --> 07:39.454
What should I do?

07:39.454 --> 07:41.114
Good morning, everyone.

07:41.654 --> 07:43.714
M-Madam Princess!

07:43.824 --> 07:49.134
Mia, I'm sorry about last night.
But I'm all right now.

07:49.134 --> 07:51.934
Then join me for a little practice.

07:51.934 --> 07:56.464
I think training with an expert
will help me improve faster.

07:56.674 --> 07:57.794
Okay.

07:59.344 --> 08:04.714
It seems you already know the basics,
so come after me a little aggressively.

08:04.714 --> 08:05.474
Okay.

08:05.944 --> 08:07.214
Whenever you're ready.

08:07.654 --> 08:08.944
Then here I come!

08:14.724 --> 08:16.954
You're relying too much on upper-body strength!

08:17.224 --> 08:18.694
Dammit!

08:36.444 --> 08:38.774
Why didn't you hit me just now?

08:39.814 --> 08:40.644
I...

08:41.684 --> 08:45.124
I'm being serious! I want you to be serious, too!

08:45.124 --> 08:46.384
So why?!

08:48.024 --> 08:49.394
Brother!

08:49.394 --> 08:52.524
It can't be helped! If Feena wins...

08:52.524 --> 08:56.994
I know! But if she doesn't fight me seriously,
then there's no point!

08:56.994 --> 08:59.494
Y'want me to run ya through the basics?

09:00.204 --> 09:01.534
Mr. Takano!

09:01.934 --> 09:06.544
It's kinda hard when your sparrin' partner
is who you'll be fightin', huh?

09:06.544 --> 09:08.514
Mr. Takano vs. My brother?

09:08.514 --> 09:10.984
But as an elderly gentleman,
maybe you shouldn't...

09:10.984 --> 09:14.054
Mr. Takano is quite skilled.

09:14.054 --> 09:18.084
There was even talk of him teaching
sword fighting to the Royal Army.

09:18.084 --> 09:20.184
Is that true?!

09:20.454 --> 09:21.654
Feena...

09:22.794 --> 09:26.284
I've decided to fight, so...

09:29.694 --> 09:31.634
If you'd be so kind, sir.

09:37.104 --> 09:39.504
Wh-what, Midori?

09:39.504 --> 09:43.844
Has something else happened?
This time, it's Asagiri who's absent...

09:43.844 --> 09:46.574
And Feena's acting strange somehow...

09:47.314 --> 09:50.114
You and Mai, too.

09:50.984 --> 09:52.924
Time for your club activities!

09:52.924 --> 09:55.944
Natsuki, you're so mean!

10:01.894 --> 10:04.024
ASAGIRI
EARTHLIGHT

10:12.744 --> 10:13.674
Mai!

10:14.944 --> 10:20.584
Oops. My brother says he won't be back
for a while. I forgot to tell you.

10:20.584 --> 10:23.384
I hope he doesn't get injured...

10:24.824 --> 10:29.154
Is it true that you gave the
President your resignation?

10:29.154 --> 10:29.954
Yes!

10:29.954 --> 10:35.264
I think that when it becomes official,
I'll be relieved of homestay duties.

10:35.264 --> 10:38.764
I'm very sorry I won't be able to
look after you up to the end.

10:38.764 --> 10:42.494
Why should you have to apologize?
If there's anyone to blame...

10:44.004 --> 10:48.944
I simply chose to be his big sister.
I don't have any regrets.

10:53.344 --> 10:55.284
Let's go home, Feena.

10:56.654 --> 11:00.014
Oh. So that's what you were thinking.

11:00.184 --> 11:01.994
That my and Tatsuya's...

11:01.994 --> 11:06.724
No, that MY actions would be a burden
to those that have been so kind to me.

11:07.934 --> 11:10.024
I think you're overthinking things.

11:10.194 --> 11:13.994
Even you have had a hard time helping Tatsuya
cope recently, haven't you?

11:15.274 --> 11:18.244
I wouldn't go that far...

11:18.244 --> 11:20.644
I'm no good at all when I falter.

11:20.914 --> 11:25.884
None of this would be a problem
if I'd resigned my duties as princess...

11:25.884 --> 11:30.214
But I wished that I could make a dream a reality,
myself and Tatsuya together.

11:30.484 --> 11:37.014
In the end, however, I may end up losing
the dream as well. By my own hand.

11:42.164 --> 11:44.404
There's nothing wrong with faltering.

11:44.404 --> 11:45.594
Natsuki...

11:46.004 --> 11:48.664
That's how Tatsuya finally made up his mind.

11:48.834 --> 11:52.104
It's all right. You'll be able to
make this work for sure!

12:02.254 --> 12:05.044
Hey! Your legs are shakin'.

12:08.994 --> 12:10.394
You hung in there for a while this time.

12:10.724 --> 12:12.524
What do you say we take a little break?

12:12.924 --> 12:16.964
Staff! Go buy us some sports drinks!
In three seconds.

12:16.964 --> 12:18.904
And of course, you're payin' for it yourself!

12:18.904 --> 12:19.954
Yes, Boss!

12:24.644 --> 12:30.244
You're workin' hard at this, but can Feena
really fight ya with all she's got?

12:30.244 --> 12:32.484
I believe in her.

12:32.484 --> 12:37.314
But that don't mean this is
all gonna turn out roses.

12:37.314 --> 12:39.824
Our ending will of course be a happy one...

12:39.824 --> 12:45.464
Because she's the most beautiful princess
in the universe. And she loves me!

12:45.464 --> 12:49.424
I swear... You're a good guy, Tatsu!

12:54.804 --> 12:57.324
Thank you for your help this morning, Mia.

12:59.074 --> 13:03.074
I'm sorry. This will cause
trouble for you as well...

13:03.074 --> 13:08.154
I'll be happy just knowing you've had
no regrets with my service!

13:08.154 --> 13:12.484
Ah! My apologies for such a
presumptuous comment!

13:13.924 --> 13:16.084
Thank you, Mia.

13:20.264 --> 13:21.824
Feena, look!

13:22.794 --> 13:29.704
This manga is SO funny! It's sure to make
you burst out laughing, and... Uh...

13:29.804 --> 13:32.234
I don't know all the details,
but everything will turn out okay.

13:32.474 --> 13:33.874
Toyama...

13:34.114 --> 13:39.544
You and Asagiri getting together
has made us all happy, too.

13:39.844 --> 13:43.154
Anyway, it'll be okay! So cheer up!

13:43.154 --> 13:44.114
Okay?

13:44.284 --> 13:48.414
Toyama... Natsuki... Everyone...

13:49.624 --> 13:51.094
Thank you.

13:52.894 --> 13:58.664
I promise we'll take a good, long look
at Sphere Kingdom's proposal.

13:58.664 --> 14:01.654
Thank you, Madam President.

14:04.204 --> 14:05.844
Incidentally, where is Sayaka?

14:05.844 --> 14:09.174
She has her hands full getting things in order.

14:09.174 --> 14:11.334
I'm sorry for the trouble I've caused.

14:11.414 --> 14:16.684
My dear, if this will help lead to your happiness,
then it's no trouble at all.

14:17.984 --> 14:23.324
You're just like Sayaka. For the sake of a
fine young man and the girl he loves,

14:23.324 --> 14:28.094
losing your job and even slanderous or libel talk
is of no consequence.

14:28.294 --> 14:33.824
And being the kind of girls you are,
you actually seem to enjoy your situation...

14:34.274 --> 14:35.764
Oh, ma'am...

14:35.834 --> 14:40.814
The apple doesn't fall far from the tree, eh?
You really are just like Sefiria.

14:40.814 --> 14:45.004
The only difference is that you're
far too serious compared to her.

14:46.584 --> 14:53.254
Never forget, just as you always think of
the people and of those around you,

14:53.254 --> 14:56.594
all of us are praying for your happiness.

14:56.594 --> 14:58.284
My happiness...

15:02.294 --> 15:04.134
Sorry everyone.

15:04.134 --> 15:07.934
Having Mai and even Mia help out like this...

15:09.004 --> 15:12.604
It's only natural for a girl to
fill in for her big brother!

15:12.604 --> 15:18.814
I feel the same! After all, Mr. Tatsuya
could become the princess's husband!

15:18.814 --> 15:21.714
Tatsu must sure be happy.

15:21.714 --> 15:25.014
But can Tatsuya really even win?

15:26.324 --> 15:27.254
Huh?

15:27.524 --> 15:29.514
Get a clue before you open your mouth!

15:30.794 --> 15:33.524
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
Jin! I'm docking your pay again!

15:33.524 --> 15:33.864
With Thoughts of
Big Brother

15:33.864 --> 15:38.734
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
It'll be okay. My brother will pull it off somehow!

15:38.734 --> 15:42.074
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
Right! Not that I can justify that.

15:42.074 --> 15:47.044
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
The Princess always looks happiest
when she's with Mr. Tatsuya!

15:47.044 --> 15:50.314
With Thoughts of
Big Brother
It makes me happy just to see it.

15:50.314 --> 15:50.444
It makes me happy just to see it.

15:50.444 --> 15:52.034
Then everything will be fine.

15:53.314 --> 15:55.714
What are you grinning about?

15:55.714 --> 16:00.174
Those two don't have what it takes
to stab us in the back.

16:02.754 --> 16:07.754
Huh? Should I have "gotten a clue" again?

16:09.534 --> 16:11.204
Don't say that sort of thing!

16:11.204 --> 16:12.664
That's right!
That wasn't too bad for Jin...

16:12.664 --> 16:13.964
That wasn't too bad for Jin...

16:13.964 --> 16:15.434
But I'm docking your pay!

16:33.684 --> 16:38.494
Tatsuya. I am ready now.

16:39.724 --> 16:41.034
Miss Feena.

16:41.034 --> 16:43.154
The day of the test has been decided.

16:43.664 --> 16:47.724
The seventh day, midnight, here at the embassy.

16:48.204 --> 16:49.604
Understood.

16:51.844 --> 16:54.174
Thank you for this past week!

16:54.174 --> 16:56.174
Get 'er done, Tatsuya!

16:56.174 --> 16:57.274
Do your best!

16:57.514 --> 16:58.504
Okay!

17:01.184 --> 17:03.954
There will be no time limit,
with the first strike winning the match.

17:03.954 --> 17:07.014
When I have decided the victor,
I shall end the match.

17:07.484 --> 17:09.014
No objections?

17:13.124 --> 17:14.894
Very well. Begin!

17:19.464 --> 17:21.934
That upper-gate stance is used for attacks.

17:22.174 --> 17:24.434
You're serious, aren't you Feena?

17:24.774 --> 17:27.674
This is how determined I am, Tatsuya.

18:09.314 --> 18:13.774
The match is finished. Feena wins.

18:16.424 --> 18:18.554
You sure are powerful.

18:18.864 --> 18:22.094
I put everything into defense and then bet it all
on a single attack, but...

18:22.494 --> 18:28.134
You managed to stop my first strike,
even though it was one of my best techniques.

18:35.314 --> 18:40.774
Allow me to ask you one question.
Have you now abandoned your plans?

18:43.314 --> 18:47.024
No matter how difficult things become,
we will never give up.

18:47.024 --> 18:50.114
Because this love, and our dreams
have a value all their own.

18:50.354 --> 18:56.634
And to give more happiness back
to those who pray for our own.

18:56.634 --> 18:59.324
We'll go forward, together.

19:00.364 --> 19:01.734
I see.

19:05.504 --> 19:08.874
I, Karen Clavius, pledge my life
to support Tatsuya Asagiri

19:08.874 --> 19:14.684
in becoming the rightful husband of
Princess Feena Fam Earthlight.

19:14.684 --> 19:18.644
But why? Feena beat me.

19:18.854 --> 19:22.884
I believe I said my decision would rest
upon the results of the test.

19:24.124 --> 19:26.594
Karen! You...

19:26.594 --> 19:30.194
For a queen and her husband,

19:30.194 --> 19:33.304
that which is most important is to never give up,
no matter the difficulty,

19:33.304 --> 19:35.604
and to show their subjects that there is hope.

19:35.604 --> 19:40.634
Forgive me, Miss Feena, but I had to test
the extent of your preparedness.

19:40.874 --> 19:46.784
Honestly, I was troubled before when you
were shaken by a single defeat...

19:46.784 --> 19:48.144
But you pass.

19:48.554 --> 19:50.384
You are something else.

19:50.384 --> 19:53.084
Ideals alone are not sufficient
for a member of royalty.

19:53.084 --> 19:57.154
But having the indomitable spirit
needed to realize those ideals

19:57.154 --> 19:58.454
is a different story altogether.

19:58.694 --> 20:04.564
I believe that the two of you can usher in a
prosperous future for both Earth and the Moon.

20:12.144 --> 20:12.504
Letter
of
Resignation

20:13.274 --> 20:17.214
I can't have you quitting at a time
when history could be about to change.

20:17.514 --> 20:22.384
Your little brother is one of the reasons
for that change, so be responsible, okay?

20:22.384 --> 20:24.944
Yes, ma'am. I swear on my life.

20:26.724 --> 20:28.354
It looks like it's already dawn.

20:28.354 --> 20:32.024
I guess we got a little carried away
taking the long way home.

20:32.124 --> 20:36.464
The sky is such a beautiful color. It's like...

20:36.464 --> 20:39.024
The bright blue of dawn. Right?

20:39.264 --> 20:40.464
Yes.

20:50.644 --> 20:53.084
I can't eat any more...

20:53.084 --> 20:55.204
What a predicament!

20:55.384 --> 20:57.924
That was the perfect chance!

20:57.924 --> 21:01.084
Mai, why do you have to
always talk in your sleep?

21:01.084 --> 21:03.794
Well, she stayed awake all night,
so it can't be helped.

21:03.794 --> 21:06.424
Madam Princess...

21:06.824 --> 21:08.394
Everyone!

21:08.394 --> 21:09.984
What are you all doing here?

21:10.294 --> 21:14.504
Um, Mr. Takano said he could see
"something good" here...

21:14.504 --> 21:17.134
Everyone, clear out in three seconds!

21:23.114 --> 21:25.184
I just remembered something important.

21:25.184 --> 21:26.704
What's that?

21:26.814 --> 21:32.114
Something you said to me that day,
which I really wanted to say back but couldn't.

21:33.724 --> 21:35.754
I want to be with you.

21:35.754 --> 21:38.394
I want to make our dreams come true together.

21:38.394 --> 21:41.824
I love you.

21:46.104 --> 21:51.594
There can be no more delay.
Tatsuya Asagiri... Feena Fam Earthlight...

21:51.874 --> 21:53.964
The both of you!

22:09.094 --> 22:13.824
Platinum no mikazuki

22:13.824 --> 22:21.804
Ima funwari tatazunda

22:21.804 --> 22:29.074
Sora miagete omou

22:29.074 --> 22:39.554
Ano nagareboshi kitto tsuki no namida ne

